{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/91544-question-regarding-witches","id":91544,"title":"Question regarding Witches","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-03-15T04:45:15-07:00","id":91544,"title":"Question regarding Witches","content":"So, I'm working on a Witch character for a pbp game and I've run into something which is probably very obvious but has me wondering nonetheless. I've bought Gnosis 2, and it says I can draw my spells from two Mysteries of my choice, in addition to Lore.<br /> <br /> How many spells do I get? Or can I simply cast any spells from two Mysteries that I select now at chargen? Also, does my Gnosis limit what level of spell I can cast, or can I immediately cast level 5 spells provided I can pay the Source cost and make the roll?<br /> <br /> To clarify, this is using the rules for Gutter Magic from Witch Finders.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/19.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":1220,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1220-carnivalcash","user":"CarnivalCash","date":". 03-15-2014, 12:16 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1220-carnivalcash","name":"CarnivalCash","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1220_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-15T11:59:44-07:00","id":91774,"title":"","content":"Spells are bought individually with Merit points. as the Gutter Magic system is based around powers as Merits, similar to Second Sight; your ST, however, may allow bonus spells depending on your witch's level of power. (See page 138 of Witch Finders for more info.) You can cast from up to two Mysteries + Lore, and you can buy 5-dot spells to cast with providing you have the XP resources. You have to buy each individually at a time, though; you cannot know a Level 3 spell without knowing a Level 2 spell.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-15T18:35:42-07:00","id":92011,"title":"","content":"Many thanks. I was beginning to suspect that was the case.<br /> <br /> No need to keep this thread open now.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/19.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1220-carnivalcash","name":"CarnivalCash","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1220_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}